Input operand and Root acceptance
----------------------------------

Raw294 bytes are six row-major7x7 F11 matrices in EXACT order:

    a,b,c,e,knownG0,knownG1.

Every byte must be0..10. No implicit identity, sparse entries, endpoint alias,
partial matrix or new point/word action is used. The whole exact Root receipt
is schema ROOT_ACCEPTED_Q11_ORIGINAL_QUARTET_OPERAND_V1 and requires:

* root=reviewer='/root', Root_authority_granted=true;
* exact operand descriptor and original_job=[23,4];
* exact integer position/representative and full whole_orbit_sha256;
* exact current selector descriptor;
* checks.original_member_frame_faithful_orbit_G_A_equals_G=true;
* nonempty old_proof_DAG_qualification;
* complete export_program, export_result, export_actual_capture descriptors.

Additional proof_DAG_refs/export_source_gate fields from the whole Root
receipt remain preserved. These caller Sources import the adopted premise;
they do not reopen its old DAG or activate exporter code. The false exporter
template is NOT such a receipt. Root alone issues acceptance after actual
export and full mathematical scope review. Root_authority_granted=false,
null Root/reviewer or false aggregate refuse before word arithmetic.

Plans, gates and Source review
--------------------------------

Plans are ordinary whole JSON, not gzip, <=131072 bytes. Their role schemas
are Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_PROPOSER_PLAN_V1 and
Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_STRICT_PLAN_V1. Program/source pair/control descriptors,
exact294 operand, <=32768-byte actual Root acceptance, actual selector,
position/representative/orbitSHA, mask7or14, word012 length1..64 and positive
power1..256 are explicit. Exact prime_theory=f1b6 and end_IP_theory=9f52 whole
bodies are required. All actually opened fixed inputs occur once in inputs;
the strict actual hint descriptor must also be present. Source, plan, Root
gate/review/control report are joined to the same exact physical roster and
all are whole-rechecked before output. No old growing proof chain is opened.

A fresh positive gate has schema ROOT_AUTHORIZED_Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_PROPOSER_V1
or ROOT_AUTHORIZED_Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_STRICT_V1, root='/root',adopted=true,
new_case_calls_authorized=true and exact program,plan,operand_acceptance,
selector,Root_code_math_review,control_report descriptors.

The Root review schema ROOT_REVIEWED_Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_SOURCE_V1 requires
root=reviewer='/root',status='SUPPORTED',blockers=[], exact program/plan/
operand_acceptance/selector and
natural_Cayley_classification_unique37_line_and_one_full_end_IP_checked=true.
Actual controls must be Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_GENERIC_CONTROLS_V1,statusPASS,
exact control program/proposer/strict subjects and integer original_case_calls0.
No prepared author DATA or supplier result grants either gate or review.

Supplied certificate
----------------------

The canonical hint JSON schema is Q11_ORIGINAL_END37_LINE_ESCAPE_HINT_V1.
Header fields are proof_mode,grammar,operand,operand_acceptance,selector,
original_job,position,representative,whole_orbit_sha256,mask,word,power and
proposer_program, copied exactly from the bound plan. Their canonical bytes
must match, so nested bool/int/float aliases refuse. The ONLY extra fields are:

    vector: seven canonical F11 integers, not all zero;
    escape_generator: exact global mark index INSIDE this end;
    minor: two exact ordered indices0<=i<j<7.

Mask7 permits escape labels0,1,2. Mask14 permits1,2,3. No known-G label4/5 or
omitted mark can prove same-end escape. The strict reader checks exact37,
vY=v and the nonzero minor of v and v*s. It performs no RREF, fixed-space
search, proposer import, old context-code import or original orbit action.

Proposer output always result.json<=32768; only an untrusted positive also
writes canonical hint.json<=16384. No hint is written on misses/interruptions.
Strict output is result.json<=32768 with schema
Q11_OPERAND37_LINE_STRICT_RESULT_V1 and status
VERIFIED_ORIGINAL_END_EQUALS_G_AND_IP_FAILURE. All results retain source/plan/
gate/operand/receipt/selector/proof identities. Root_typed_adoption_owed=true
and new_paid_credit=whole_original_credit=0. Existing two-end spectrum or
common-line-NG result tags MUST NOT be reused for this different predicate.
A separate typed Root metadata join is needed before any count change.

